Tri-Arm reconstruction for the garden viewer.
Project: https://tnkr.ai/theaiwhisperers-workspace/tri-arm
That page is login-walled and has no public URDF. This file mounts the
Apache-2.0 SO-100 meshes onto a box harness and an 8-DOF four-finger hand,
matching the published description (SO-100 + 4-finger hand + shoulder harness).
SO-100 meshes: public/robots/so100 (TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100).
